Package: machinaiq-uplc
Version: 1.0.0
Section: industrial
Priority: optional
Architecture: armhf
Depends: libqt6core6 (>= 6.4), libqt6widgets6 (>= 6.4), libqt6network6 (>= 6.4), libqt6serialport6 (>= 6.4)
Maintainer: MachinaIQ <support@machinaiq.io>
Description: MachinaIQ UPLC Industrial HMI
 Touchscreen HMI for screwdriving station control on Raspberry Pi.
 Communicates via Serial and TCP/IP; real-time screw count and
 status display with full configuration hierarchy management.
